# main-tema-sprint-eco: the Sprint theme on a nearly flat battery with no
# external supply (main-bateria-baja's state: the clock drops to the
# battery-percentage view because the external supply is below 3 V, and 10.6 V
# without a source puts the visual policy in VP_ECO, so the waterfall runs at its
# saved cadence). Same radio state as that fixture with the theme as the only
# variable, so the render is Sprint's low-battery/ECO state.

name main-tema-sprint-eco
screen main

theme Sprint
seed 44

frequency_hz 7100000
tx_frequency_hz 7100000
fft_width_hz 384000

mode lsb
vfo A
agc slow

split false
att false
pre false
atu false
ant 1

smeter_db -95

battery_v 10.6
external_v 0.0
battery_cap 7
charging false

rxtx rx
